text><text x=\"30.0 42.0 55.6 101.3 117.0 140.3 148.6 156.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> rabbın neyi dilerse halkeder ve ıhtiyar eyler - ya'ni dilediğini halkeder ve halkettiklerinden dilediğini de seçer beğenir, risalet, şefaat gibi yüksek işlere intibah eyer<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"165\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 165.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 30.7 37.4 37.4 50.2 50.2 57.7 73.4 73.4 82.4 82.4 90.7 107.2 117.7 124.4 135.7 142.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 30.7 90.7 107.2 124.4 142.4 149.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onların değildir o ıhtiyar - binaenaleyh onların Allahdan başka şürekâ, şüfeâ ıhtiyâr ve intibahına hakları yoktur.</p><p>71.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"74\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 74.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 32.3 39.0 39.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"32.3 46.6 46.6 57.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> sermedî - muttarıd, dâim. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"445\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 445.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 13.6 29.3 29.3 36.0 42.7 49.6 49.6 56.3 63.0 63.0 69.7 87.0 87.0 87.0 96.0 96.0 104.3 104.3 111.0 117.7 135.7 147.0 147.0 153.7 160.6 176.3 187.6 198.7 207.0 207.0 222.7 222.7 229.6 229.6 237.7 253.6 253.6 264.0 264.0 279.7 290.3 297.0 317.3 327.7 336.0 336.0 344.3 351.0 366.7 366.7 377.3 377.3 393.0 406.6 417.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text 